    {
      "name": "department_id",
      "type": [
        "null",
        "string"
      ],
      "default": null,
      "doc": "Department the window belongs to. Measured population 2026-08-03: LAGER | MECH | MONTAGE | SG. NOT declared as an enum: the plant may add a department without a schema change, and a consumer must never treat an unknown department as 'not scheduled'. Part of the composite key."
    },
